From 13801aee2ded2fff54677c2cbdc38496438fde6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 03:36:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Fix vocab demote within 3-day grace and persist test
 attempts.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Stop inactivity decay/demote for the first 3 Seoul calendar idle days
(Arthur-style false demote). Score every daily-test submit on the 0–400
ladder so 7/10 (+6) cannot demote alone, and append each attempt
(correct/total/delta) to vocab_daily_progress plus the activity feed.
Use Asia/Seoul for quest "today" on UTC hosts.
